# Cloudflare Pages header rules.
#
# One rule per path pattern. Pages APPENDS values when two matching rules set
# the same header rather than letting the later one win — a Cache-Control in
# /* plus another in /assets/* produced the literal header
#   public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, public, max-age=604800
# and browsers take the first max-age they parse, so assets were revalidating
# on every request instead of caching for a week. So /* carries no
# Cache-Control at all, and the caching rules use patterns that cannot overlap.
#
# CSP is tight because the site has no inline script, no inline style and no
# inline event handlers — verified. The only external origin is Google Fonts.
# img-src allows data: for two CSS background SVGs: the hero's route line and
# the select chevron, which appearance:none removes and this replaces.
#
# The Google Analytics origins are Google's own documented CSP list. GA needs
# three directives, not just script-src: the loader is a script, the measurement
# beacons are connect-src, and it falls back to image pixels when a beacon is
# blocked or the page is unloading.
#
# frame-ancestors names Google's tag tools rather than 'none': Tag Assistant and
# the GA4 tag check load the page in a frame, and a blanket 'none' makes the tag
# undetectable however well it is installed. X-Frame-Options is deliberately gone
# — it only understands DENY/SAMEORIGIN, so it would override the line above and
# re-block them. frame-ancestors is its modern replacement and every current
# browser honours it, so clickjacking protection is unchanged for everyone else.
#
# The gtag config block is inline because Google's own tag detection scans the
# page source for it and does not find it in an external file. 'unsafe-inline'
# is still NOT here: script-src carries the SHA-256 of that exact block, so the
# browser runs those four lines and nothing else. Change one byte of the snippet
# and the hash must be regenerated or the tag stops running.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self' https://tagassistant.google.com https://www.googletagmanager.com; object-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-41TyxF2oaQzcXJmNcz/BDcUE7PSQuBElyt9K61GNd8c=' https://*.googletagmanager.com; style-src 'self' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.googletagmanager.com; media-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com https://*.googletagmanager.com; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=(), interest-cohort=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin

# Caching is split by how often a file actually changes, because none of these
# filenames carry a content hash. /assets/* on a 7-day cache meant a CSS edit
# stayed invisible at the edge for a week after deploying — the deployment was
# correct and the live hostname still served the old file.
#
# These patterns must not overlap: Pages appends the values of every matching
# rule rather than letting the most specific win, so /assets/* alongside
# /assets/img/* would produce two max-ages in one header and the first wins.

# markup and code — revalidate, so a deploy is live the moment it lands
/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/packages/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/plans/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/assets/boost.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/assets/boost.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/assets/nojs.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# photography, video and the brand marks — these do not change, cache hard
/assets/img/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
/assets/video/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
/assets/logo-dark.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
/assets/logo-light.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
/assets/icon-32.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
/assets/icon-180.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
